                "golden",
                "me",
                "heartbeat"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The restoration path for a Golden Donor who went quiet for six months. Opening the app IS the whole proof of life required, so there is nothing to apply for and no admin in the loop.\n\nLook for `priority_restored: true` on the call that flips them back."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.4a Relocate out of Dhaka  ⭐ corner case",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{user_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
