            "description": "A dry run — it writes nothing and pings nobody.\n\nOn an ICU request the proven donors come back at the top. Watch for a holder whose priority is suspended: they sit in the STANDARD tier, at their real distance, possibly behind a donor with one donation. That is the ghost-donor rule visible in the ordering.\n\nRun it against a non-ICU request and icu_priority comes back false with the pool in plain distance order."
          }
